#. type: Content of: <div><h1>
#: download.html:5
msgid "Download SLFS"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <div><h2>
#: download.html:7
msgid "SLFS Releases"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <div><p>
#: download.html:9
msgid ""
"On the SLFS site, the book is rolling release and is often rendered right "
"after the last Git commit or batch of commits in the Git source.  However, "
"there are chunked HTML <a href=\"https://github.com/glfs-book/slfs/"
"releases\">releases</a>.  Each of them are versioned with the first four or "
"more unique characters of the <a href=\"https://graphite.dev/guides/git-"
"hashing\">Git hash</a> at the time of release. There are unstable (or pre-"
"release) releases and stable releases. If you don't want to download a "
"release, you can also render the book yourself. Stable releases will also "
"show how to render a local copy of the stable version on each Github release "
"listing."
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <div><h2>
#: download.html:22
msgid "SLFS Git"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <div><p>
#: download.html:24
msgid "SLFS can be obtained from the Github repository:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <div><div><p>
#: download.html:26
msgid "git clone https://github.com/glfs-book/slfs"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <div><p>
#: download.html:29
msgid "You can update the source by doing:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <div><div><p>
#: download.html:30
msgid "git pull"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <div><h2>
#: download.html:33
msgid "Rendering the SLFS book"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <div><p>
#: download.html:35
msgid ""
"Rendering works the same way as it does with the *LFS books.  Read the "
"included <tt>INSTALL.md</tt> for finding out what packages you need in order "
"to render the book in the way you want to.  <tt>README.md</tt> also provides "
"information like rendering options you may want to set."
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <div><p>
#: download.html:42
msgid ""
"If you want to render the Systemd version of the book, for example, run:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <div><div><p>
#: download.html:45
msgid "make REV=systemd"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <div><h2>
#: download.html:48
msgid "Packages for SLFS"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <div><p>
#: download.html:50
msgid ""
"SLFS has a list of packages which you can download. Please use the versions "
"listed in the book unless you know what you are doing."
msgstr ""
